  g("path", "file path", "path (lokasi file)", ["path", "paths"], "mod-0-1", 2, "The address of a file or folder, such as data/orders.csv. Absolute paths start at the root; relative ones start from where you are.", "Alamat sebuah file atau folder, misalnya data/orders.csv. Path absolut mulai dari akar; path relatif mulai dari posisimu.");
