  g("null", "NULL", "NULL", [], "mod-0-3", 3, "'Unknown or missing'. It is not zero and not empty text, and it makes comparisons behave in surprising ways.", "'Tidak diketahui atau kosong'. Bukan nol dan bukan teks kosong, dan membuat perbandingan berperilaku mengejutkan.");
